{{Passive skill box|Call to Arms}}

'''Call to Arms''' is a [[keystone passive skill]] which [[warcry]] skills to have more warcry duration, but causes them to no longer grant [[buff]]s or [[charge]]s to the user.

This keystone primarily focuses on the supportive aspects of warcries for your [[minion]]s or other [[allies]], including [[party]] members.

==Location==
Call to Arms is located on the southwest edge of the skill tree. 

