==Version history==
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.25.0|
* The Warlord's Call Keystone Passive Skill is once again known as Call to Arms. It no longer provides "Warcries no longer Exert Attacks" or "Warcries also grant their buffs to nearby Allies". Instead, it now provides 100% more Warcry Duration, and "Warcries do not grant Buffs or Charges to you".
}}
{{Version history table row|3.24.1|
* Fixed a bug where items that granted the Warlord's Call Keystone Passive Skill still displayed as Call to Arms.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.24.0|
* The Call To Arms Keystone Passive Skill has been renamed to Warlord's Call. It now provides "Warcries no longer Exert Attacks" and "Warcries also grant their buff to nearby allies" (previously "Using Warcries is Instant" and "Warcries share their Cooldown").
